<main id="main">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
    <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <img class="hero-photo" src="images/hero-carport.jpg" alt="Verandah with dark steel frame and translucent roof over a timber deck" width="1400" height="1119" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-copy rv" id="heroCopy">
      <p class="hero-kicker">Verandahs &amp; Carports &middot; Melbourne VIC</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title" data-ux="words">Verandahs &amp; Carports Built to Last</h1>
      <p>Melbourne's specialist in custom outdoor structures. From footings to finished roof - we handle every stage.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quote">Get a quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#services">What we do</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="section services rv" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <span class="kicker">What We Build</span>
        <h2 id="services-title">Outdoor Structures for Melbourne Homes</h2>
        <p>Every project is designed and constructed by our team - no subcontractors, no shortcuts.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card rv">
          
          <h3>Verandah Design & Construction</h3>
          <p>Custom verandahs that extend your living space outdoors. Gable, skillion, flat or curved roofs - designed for your home's architecture and Melbourne's weather.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv">
          
          <h3>Carport Design & Construction</h3>
          <p>Single, double, and multi-bay carports with integrated storage options. Steel or timber frames, Colorbond roofing - built to protect your vehicles year-round.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv">
          
          <h3>Custom Outdoor Structures</h3>
          <p>Pergolas, patios, outdoor kitchens, and shade structures. If you can dream it, we build it - tailored to your site, budget, and lifestyle.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="process" class="section process rv" aria-labelledby="process-title">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <span class="kicker">How We Work</span>
        <h2 id="process-title">From Footings to Finished</h2>
        <p>A clear, fixed-price process - no surprises, no hidden variations.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="flow-stages">
        <article class="process-step rv">
          <h3>Design & Permits</h3>
          <p>Site measure, 3D design, engineering, and council permits handled end-to-end. You approve the plans before we break ground.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step rv">
          <h3>Footings & Frames</h3>
          <p>Concrete footings poured to engineer's spec. Steel or timber posts, beams, and rafters erected - the frame goes up fast.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step rv">
          <h3>Roof & Flashings</h3>
          <p>Colorbond sheets fixed bay by bay. Ridge capping, flashings, and gutters sealed watertight. The structure is weatherproof.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step rv">
          <h3>Handover</h3>
          <p>Final walk-through, paperwork, and warranty docs. Your keys, your car rolls in - job complete.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

